## Exercise 8 — reduced motion, live

Edit `ex8/solution.tsx`. Respect the setting, and notice when it changes.

Export:

```tsx
export function usePrefersReducedMotion(): boolean;

export function Drawer(props: {
  open: boolean;
  children: ReactNode;
