## Exercise 3 — user timing

Edit `ex3/solution.tsx`. Put your own names into the browser's timeline.

Export:

```tsx
export function useInteractionTiming(name: string): {
  begin: () => void;
};

export function FilterPanel(props: {
  options: string[];
  onMeasure?: (durationMs: number) => void;
