```

Requirements:

- typing in the search box must re-render **only** the components that read the
  query;
- `Header` and `Sidebar` must not render at all on a keystroke;
- a component that only calls `useSetQuery` must not re-render when the query
  changes — the setter's identity must be stable;
- each hook throws a named error when used outside `AppProvider`;
- nothing may rely on `memo` — the gate renders the consumers without it.

The gate renders one of each consumer wrapped in a render counter, types five
characters, and asserts the query-reading consumer rendered five times while the
other two rendered once each.

```
